      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change is adding close to 1 MiB inside the apex.\nIt\u0027s increasing the size by 5%. This is HUGE !\n\nI believe the libPlatformProperties should be linked statically to only fetch the symbols we need.\n\nIs this possible ?",
